AB  - This update will describe the paediatric highlights from the 2013 European 
      Respiratory Society (ERS) annual congress in Barcelona, Spain. Abstracts from the 
      seven groups of the ERS Paediatric Assembly (Respiratory Physiology and Sleep, 
      Asthma and Allergy, Cystic Fibrosis, Respiratory Infection and Immunology, 
      Neonatology and Paediatric Intensive Care, Respiratory Epidemiology, and 
      Bronchology) have been chosen by group officers and are presented in the context 
      of current literature.
