AB  - The aim of this update is to describe the paediatric highlights from the 2010 
      European Respiratory Society Annual Congress in Barcelona, Spain. Abstracts from 
      the seven groups of the Paediatric Assembly (Respiratory physiology, Asthma and 
      allergy, Cystic fibrosis, Respiratory infection and immunology, Neonatology and 
      paediatric intensive care, Respiratory epidemiology and Bronchology) are 
      presented in the context of the current literature.
