TI  - Selected clinical highlights from the 2010 ERS Congress in Barcelona.
PG  - 209-17
LID - 10.1183/09031936.00039011 [doi]
AB  - This article reviews a selection of presentations at the 2010 annual meeting of 
      the European Respiratory Society held in Barcelona, Spain, which was the largest 
      congress ever in the field of respiratory medicine. The best abstracts from the 
      groups of the Clinical Assembly (Clinical Problems, Rehabilitation and Chronic 
      Care, Imaging, Interventional Pulmonology, Diffuse Parenchymal Lung Disease, and 
      General Practice and Primary Care) are presented in the context of the current 
      literature.
