TI  - Outcomes for COPD pharmacological trials: from lung function to biomarkers.
PG  - 416-69
LID - 10.1183/09031936.00099306 [doi]
AB  - The American Thoracic Society/European Respiratory Society jointly created a Task 
      Force on "Outcomes for COPD pharmacological trials: from lung function to 
      biomarkers" to inform the chronic obstructive pulmonary disease research 
      community about the possible use and limitations of current outcomes and markers 
      when evaluating the impact of a pharmacological therapy. Based on their review of 
      the published literature, the following document has been prepared with 
      individual sections that address specific outcomes and markers, and a final 
      section that summarises their recommendations.
